Gemini GPT Desktop — Instructions
Overview

A Gemini-style dark-mode desktop chat app with Free, Plus, and Premium tiers.
Free tier uses GPT-5, Premium can use GPT-5 Pro with advanced features.

Setup

Install Python 3.10+
Make sure Python is installed and added to your PATH.

Install dependencies
Open a terminal / command prompt and run:

pip install PyQt6 openai


Run the app

python yourfilename.py


First launch will ask for your OpenAI API key.

Enter your key to start chatting.

Usage

Free tier

Max 50 messages per day

Responses come from GPT-5

Banner reminds you of limits

Occasional simulated errors or delays to mimic “Free tier experience”

Plus / Premium (requires unlock codes you define)

GPT-5 Pro responses

Premium features include:

System prompt customization

Temperature slider for response randomness

Reset conversation

Clears chat history

Resets daily free-tier usage

Toggle theme

Switch between dark and light mode

Local Storage

Data saved in app_data.json includes:

Subscription tier

Daily usage

System prompt

Temperature setting

Notes

Do not commit your OpenAI API key

Free tier intentionally simulates slower responses and errors

Unlock codes and Premium features are configurable inside the code

The app is fully local except for GPT API requests
